		{"id":"text_0179","type":"text","text":"斯坦福 心理学学位，随后转AI","x":1555,"y":-7303,"width":227,"height":26},
		{"id":"text_0181","type":"text","text":"http://incompleteideas.net/","x":1340,"y":-7170,"width":259,"height":56},
		{"id":"text_0180","type":"text","text":"2024 年图灵奖","x":1320,"y":-7243,"width":119,"height":26},
		{"id":"text_0155","type":"text","text":"具身智能/自动驾驶","x":1175,"y":-7007,"width":150,"height":26},
		{"id":"text_0154","type":"text","text":"ChatGPT，2023","x":1258,"y":-7078,"width":135,"height":50},
		{"id":"text_0153","type":"text","text":"AlphaGO， 2016","x":1057,"y":-7127,"width":135,"height":26},
		{"id":"text_0098","type":"text","text":"强化学习（Reinforcement Learning，RL）是机器学习的一个重要分支，其核心研究目标是让智能体\n在与环境的持续交互中，通过试探与反馈的循环过程，学习能够最大化长期累积奖励的行动策略。","x":1280,"y":-6900,"width":735,"height":48},
		{"id":"text_0105","type":"text","text":"用符号rt+1表示，反映当前动作的好坏程度。","x":1875,"y":-6000,"width":338,"height":26}
	],
